id: int url: str title: str | None created_at: datetime

requirements.requirement:
Define the request model `TagAttach`:
class TagAttach(BaseModel): tags: list[str] = Field(min_length=1)
- `tags` is required. A request body with no `tags` key is invalid. - `min_length=1` rejects an empty list, because the feature attaches "one or more" tag names. - Tag names are free text and are carried through exactly as submitted. Do NOT lowercase, uppercase, strip whitespace, deduplicate, sort or otherwise normalise them in the schema. Case-sensitive matching is required by the tag-links notes/considerations block, and any folding here would defeat it. Skipping names already attached is task L3-006's job, done against the database, not here.
